{"name": "SinsKiller", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fight through endless hordes of demons in a fast-paced twin-stick shooter where precise movement, powerful spells and build mastery are the keys to survival. Unlock devastating power ups, forge unique builds and face the living embodiment of your sins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EARN YOUR REDEMPTION.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras_big/d7815758ab91ecbec0a5f20532859623.webp?t=1787300169\" height=\"223\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/d7815758ab91ecbec0a5f20532859623.avif?t=1787300169\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Battle through deadly arenas filled with demonic hordes and environmental hazards. Survive long enough to reach the ruler of each circle and face a brutal bullet-hell boss encounter that stands between you and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/7e5f3d063236e7874b20f345c188521f.poster.avif?t=1787300169\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/7e5f3d063236e7874b20f345c188521f.webm?t=1787300169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/7e5f3d063236e7874b20f345c188521f.mp4?t=1787300169\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras_big/602be555c3669f4c758b11a403c901bf.webp?t=1787300169\" height=\"223\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/602be555c3669f4c758b11a403c901bf.avif?t=1787300169\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Precise movements, fast dashes through impossible bullet patterns, bullet absorption, timed execution events. Learn every mechanic, master every encounter and turn the bullet hell into a bullet heaven where you are in complete control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/842f5c4754537677a0a319437483722b.poster.avif?t=1787300169\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/842f5c4754537677a0a319437483722b.webm?t=1787300169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/842f5c4754537677a0a319437483722b.mp4?t=1787300169\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras_big/9159537ed84fb2636286060d24459b19.webp?t=1787300169\" height=\"223\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/9159537ed84fb2636286060d24459b19.avif?t=1787300169\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Death and suffering is not the end, it's part of the journey. Complete quests, earn permanent upgrades, unlock new loadout options and expand your arsenal between runs. Progress through a skill-driven system that rewards mastery and opens new possibilities for future descents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/c742ea9342d716435404770320d18314.poster.avif?t=1787300169\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/c742ea9342d716435404770320d18314.webm?t=1787300169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/c742ea9342d716435404770320d18314.mp4?t=1787300169\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras_big/b07088aaea7318d1f773fdec10d055d1.webp?t=1787300169\" height=\"223\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/b07088aaea7318d1f773fdec10d055d1.avif?t=1787300169\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Shape your power through elemental magic. Invest skill points into elemental paths and enhance your spells with powerful upgrades. Add ricochets, chaining effects and other game-changing traits as you discover synergies between vows, relics and elemental powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/b2e56c6ef05facb7b0e503550b89810c.poster.avif?t=1787300169\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/b2e56c6ef05facb7b0e503550b89810c.webm?t=1787300169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/b2e56c6ef05facb7b0e503550b89810c.mp4?t=1787300169\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras_big/8467287ffcc43d3347adf71c17da7e69.webp?t=1787300169\" height=\"223\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/8467287ffcc43d3347adf71c17da7e69.avif?t=1787300169\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Compete against players around the world on global leaderboards, perfect your runs and climb the rankings. Push your skills to the limit and show everyone who the true sinslayer is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/b39b0d71ba1202235668dab87b603e54.poster.avif?t=1787300169\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/b39b0d71ba1202235668dab87b603e54.webm?t=1787300169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/b39b0d71ba1202235668dab87b603e54.mp4?t=1787300169\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras_big/58b90a89e4710caa3f4cb579d244ba02.webp?t=1787300169\" height=\"223\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/extras/58b90a89e4710caa3f4cb579d244ba02.avif?t=1787300169\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "SinsKiller is an isometric action arcade shooter set in a Dante-inspired Hell. Play as a fallen battle-mage wielding arcane power to obliterate demonic hordes and face brutal bosses. Face your sins. Kill them. Earn your redemption.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280460/fd2b8eadeae4e468510fbdcc08f5809ab37a51db/header.jpg?t=1787300169", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Bullet Hell", "Arcade", "Action", "Score Attack", "Shooter", "Bullet Heaven"], "developers": "Kimera Forge", "publishers": "Kimera Forge", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4280460", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "12 August 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/huhZNTZ1YGY", "first_seen": 1786492800.0, "review_rank": 117}